<p class="caption">Source: The detrended credit-to-GDP ratio (shown in standard deviation units) is from Chicago Fed staff calculations based on data from Haver Analytics.</p>

<p>More information on the nonfinancial leverage subindex can be found in "<a title="Detecting early signs of financial instability" href="/publications/chicago-fed-letter/2012/december-305">Detecting Early Signs of Financial Instability</a>."</p>



